<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div><div class="eyebrow">Your beginner-friendly guide</div><h1>Learn skills.<br>Find opportunities.<br>Earn smarter.</h1><p>Clear, practical guides to digital skills, freelancing and legitimate online platforms—with Nigerian beginners in mind.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#skills">Explore digital skills ↓</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#platforms">Browse platforms</a></div></div>
<aside class="hero-card"><h3>Start with a simple plan</h3><ul><li>Choose one useful digital skill.</li><li>Learn the basics with free resources.</li><li>Create two or three sample projects.</li><li>Apply to real opportunities and keep improving.</li></ul><p class="note">No income is guaranteed. Results depend on your skills, effort, demand and access to suitable opportunities.</p></aside>
</div></section>
<section class="section" id="skills"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="kicker">Build your foundation</div><h2>Digital skills you can start learning</h2><p>Pick one path to begin. You do not need to learn everything at once.</p></div>
<div class="grid">
<article class="card"><div class="ico">✍️</div><h3>Writing & editing</h3><p>Practice clear writing, proofreading, research and simple blog articles. Build a small portfolio before applying for work.</p><a href="https://www.coursera.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore learning courses ↗</a></article>
<article class="card"><div class="ico">🎨</div><h3>Graphic design</h3><p>Learn layout, typography and social-media graphics. Make sample flyers and posts to demonstrate your ability.</p><a href="https://www.canva.com/designschool/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Canva Design School ↗</a></article>
<article class="card"><div class="ico">📊</div><h3>Spreadsheets & admin</h3><p>Practice data entry, formatting, Google Sheets or Excel basics, document preparation and virtual-assistant tasks.</p><a href="https://support.google.com/a/users/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn Google Workspace ↗</a></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section feature" id="work"><div class="wrap two"><div><div class="kicker">Turn learning into action</div><h2>How to work toward your first online client</h2><p>Focus on proof of skill, not promises of quick money. Start with small projects and keep records of your applications.</p><div class="warning" id="safety"><strong>Watch out for online-work scams</strong>Be cautious if someone asks you to pay a registration fee to unlock a job, promises guaranteed daily returns, requests your banking PIN/OTP, or pressures you to recruit others.</div></div>
<div class="steps">
<div class="step"><span class="num">1</span><div><h3>Choose one skill</h3><p>Pick something you can practice using your phone or an available computer.</p></div></div>
<div class="step"><span class="num">2</span><div><h3>Create examples</h3><p>Make a few sample designs, documents, writing pieces or spreadsheet tasks.</p></div></div>
<div class="step"><span class="num">3</span><div><h3>Prepare a profile</h3><p>Describe your skills honestly and show your samples. Never claim experience you do not have.</p></div></div>
<div class="step"><span class="num">4</span><div><h3>Apply carefully</h3><p>Check each platform's country eligibility, fees, payout methods and current terms before investing time.</p></div></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="platforms"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="kicker">Research before signing up</div><h2>Places to explore</h2><p>These are starting points for research, not promises of work or income. Availability and payment options can change.</p></div>
<div class="resources">
<div class="resource"><div><strong>Upwork</strong><p>Freelance marketplace for client projects. Review its fees, proposal rules and eligibility.</p></div><a href="https://www.upwork.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official site ↗</a></div>
<div class="resource"><div><strong>Fiverr</strong><p>Marketplace where freelancers offer defined services. Check current seller and payout requirements.</p></div><a href="https://www.fiverr.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official site ↗</a></div>
<div class="resource"><div><strong>Coursera</strong><p>Explore courses and check which learning options are free; certificates may cost extra.</p></div><a href="https://www.coursera.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official site ↗</a></div>
<div class="resource"><div><strong>Google Skillshop</strong><p>Training for Google products and digital marketing topics, with courses and certifications that vary.</p></div><a href="https://skillshop.withgoogle.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official site ↗</a></div>
</div>
